SUMMARY:U of T Engineering Research Conference 2026
DESCRIPTION:The University of Toronto Faculty of Applied Science & Engineering will be showcasing its research during the 6th annual University of Toronto Engineering Research Conference (UTERC) 2026. \nUTERC 2026 will take place on August 21st\, 2026 at the Myhal Centre for Innovation and Entrepreneurship at the St. George Campus of the University of Toronto \nProgram at a glance: \n\nNetworking\nKeynote Talks\nOral Presentations\nPoster Presentations\n\nFull event details and schedule can be found on the conference page.
URL:https://www.engineering.utoronto.ca/event/u-of-t-engineering-research-conference-2026/
LOCATION:Myhal Centre for Engineering Innovation & Entrepreneurship\, 55 St. George Street
CATEGORIES:Lectures, seminars and workshops,Socials
END:VEVENT
