SUMMARY:U of T Alumni go to the Toronto Blue Jays Game
DESCRIPTION:U of T alumni gather for a classic night at the ball game as the Toronto Blue Jays take on the Detroit Tigers. Let’s hit the stands to cheer on the home team. \nYour ticket includes: \n\nToronto Blue Jays game (sections 514 and 515)\nBlue Jays x U of T baseball cap ($40+ value)\n\n\nAlumni may bring one guest. Group seating arrangements are indicated during the registration process. \nHosted by the Faculty of Arts & Science\, Faculty of Applied Science & Engineering\, Faculty of Kinesiology & Physical Education\, and the University of Toronto Mississauga. \n\n\nEvent Details:\nDate: September 14\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM – 10:00 PM\nLocation: Rogers Centre\, 1 Blue Jays Way\, Toronto\nPrice: $45 per ticket (including custom Blue Jays x U of T ballcap)\n Register now!  \nQuestions? \nEmail events@engineering.utoronto.ca
URL:https://www.engineering.utoronto.ca/event/u-of-t-alumni-go-to-the-toronto-blue-jays-game/
LOCATION:Rogers Centre
CATEGORIES:Alumni events
END:VEVENT
